2026-07-27T09:17:30.0900563Z i /tmp/RtmpBf9O0A/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0900825Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0901125Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0901383Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0901769Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0902334Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:17:30.0903081Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
